{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":12,"ref":"esther 9:12","book":"esther","lang":"ff","chapter":9,"translation":"Laamɗo on wi'i Ester laamɗo debbo on: 'E Shushan dundiral ndin Yahuudiyankooɓe ɓen ngarbii, mbonii worɓe teemede joye, e ⟨את⟩ ɓiɓɓe Haman sappo; e leyɗe laamɗo on goɗɗe ɗen ko ɓe mbaɗii? Hol ko naamnaande maa nden, yo hokke maa; hol ko ɓataake maa on ɓeydantaango, yo waɗe?'","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"wi'i"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"Laamɗo on"},{"surface":"לאסתר","gloss":"Ester"},{"surface":"המלכה","gloss":"laamɗo debbo on"},{"surface":"בשושן","gloss":"e Shushan"},{"surface":"הבירה","gloss":"dundiral ndin"},{"surface":"הרגו","gloss":"ngarbii"},{"surface":"היהודים","gloss":"Yahuudiyankooɓe ɓen"},{"surface":"ואבד","gloss":"mbonii"},{"surface":"חמש","gloss":"joye"},{"surface":"מאות","gloss":"teemedde"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"worɓe"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"e ⟨את⟩","marks":"ɓiɓɓe Haman sappo"},{"surface":"עשרת","gloss":"sappo"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"ɓiɓɓe"},{"surface":"המן","gloss":"Haman"},{"surface":"בשאר","gloss":"e ... goɗɗe"},{"surface":"מדינות","gloss":"leyɗe"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"laamɗo on"},{"surface":"מה","gloss":"ko ɓe mbaɗii"},{"surface":"עשו","gloss":"mbaɗii"},{"surface":"ומה","gloss":"hol ko"},{"surface":"שאלתך","gloss":"naamnaande maa"},{"surface":"וינתן","gloss":"yo hokke"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"maa"},{"surface":"ומה","gloss":"hol ko"},{"surface":"בקשתך","gloss":"ɓataake maa on"},{"surface":"עוד","gloss":"ɓeydantaango"},{"surface":"ותעש","gloss":"yo waɗe"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-14T10:31:49.379179374Z","model":"glm-5.3"}